/E (CLEANING Clean dirt away from the screen. Take aim at a piece of dirt, fire and see it satisfyingly wash away. Complete a section to increase your score at the top of the screen and hear a satisfying ding, just like the original! Be careful, sections 2-3-5-6 take more effort!)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
