/P 52 0 R
/T (This project proves that the Atari 2600 is still capable of achieving its original aims, going further by imitating a ninth-generation console game, Power Wash Simulator, on the second-generation console with this game, Power Wash Simulator 2600. Future work can go onto push the console further, or explore other old technology and discover new innovations from the past.)
